pmc:ChaosMagicParadigmShiftingYieldsAdjustingSelves a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Paganism, taken up as a paradigm, explores and adjusts one's selves"@en, "Das Heidentum, als Paradigma ergriffen, erkundet und stellt die eigenen Selbste ein"@de ;
    skos:definition "Paganism is called a superb instrument for exploring and adjusting one's various different selves."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicParadigmShifting ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicAdjustingSelves ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
