pmc:ChaosMagicMediumship a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Minor parapsychological abilities of mediums, including telepathic access to a client's memories"@en, "Geringe parapsychologische Fähigkeiten von Medien, darunter telepathischer Zugang zu den Erinnerungen des Klienten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Spiritualist seance-effects, at their infrequent best, are said to argue for little more than minor parapsychological abilities, including some telepathic access to the client's memories by the medium."@en ;
    skos:note "Entered as a capacity at the strength the work allows it, at the infrequent best of seances, against the spiritualist reading of the same effects."@en ;
