    skos:definition "Magical tricks with altered states of consciousness, symbols, sigils, mirrors and mantras are said to exist to allow the subconscious to act without conscious interference."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
