pmc:ChaosMagicSubconsciousTricksYieldSubliminalReading a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Altered states, symbols, sigils, mirrors and mantras let the subconscious act without interference"@en, "Veränderte Zustände, Symbole, Sigillen, Spiegel und Mantras lassen das Unbewusste ungestört wirken"@de ;
    skos:definition "The subliminal reading of memory is the most magically effective, and this is the reason for the tricks with altered states, symbols, sigils, mirrors and mantras, which allow the subconscious to act without conscious interference."@en ;
