    skos:definition "The observances of the Monks and Nuns of Chaos have as their stated purpose the renewal and strengthening of dedication to the Great Work of Magic, the staff increasing vigilance."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicMonasticObservances ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicRenewedDedication ;
