pmc:ChaosMagicLiberNullBeforeLiberKaos a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Liber Null and Psychonaut read before Liber Kaos"@en, "Liber Null and Psychonaut vor Liber Kaos gelesen"@de ;
    skos:definition "In the references the author suggests that Liber Null and Psychonaut be read prior to Liber Kaos."@en ;
    skos:note "Entered as prescribed order: a suggestion without a stated consequence. The other references carry one-line judgements (Crowley: read what you can, there is too much; Gleick: flawed but interesting; Spare: read it all, there is not much) that are not entered."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmw:LiberKaos ;
    pm:priorStep pmw:LiberNullAndPsychonaut ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:prescribedOrder ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:LiberKaos ;
    dcterms:source "Carroll, Liber Kaos (Boston and York Beach: Weiser Books; first published 1992, printing of 2003), References, p. 217; read in a full-text layer whose running heads carry the page" .


